{"content":[{"c":["UZZI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Descendant of Eliezer who was in the direct ancestral line of high priests, though he apparently never served in that capacity (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.5-6,51","r":"1Chr.6.5-6,51","rawR":"1Chr.6.5-6,51","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.5-6,51","value":"1Chr.6.5-6,51"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:5-6, 51"},"). He is listed as the son of Bukki and the father of Zerahiah; he was a lineal ancestor of Zadok and later Ezra (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.7.4","r":"Ezra.7.4","rawR":"Ezra.7.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.7.4","value":"Ezra.7.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 7:4"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Clan chief and mighty warrior of the tribe of Issachar. He was one of the six sons of Tola and the father of Izrahiah, his successor as clan chief (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.2-3","r":"1Chr.7.2-3","rawR":"1Chr.7.2-3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.2-3","value":"1Chr.7.2-3"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:2-3"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Clan chief and mighty warrior of Benjamin’s tribe, listed as one of the sons of Bela (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.7","r":"1Chr.7.7","rawR":"1Chr.7.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.7","value":"1Chr.7.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Head of one of the Benjaminite clans that returned from Babylon, listed as the son of Micri and the father of Elah (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.8","r":"1Chr.9.8","rawR":"1Chr.9.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.8","value":"1Chr.9.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:8"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. One of the overseers of the Levites in Jerusalem, listed as the son of Bani from the clan of Asaph (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.22","r":"Neh.11.22","rawR":"Neh.11.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.22","value":"Neh.11.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Head of the priestly house of Jedaiah during the days of Joiakim the high priest (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.19","r":"Neh.12.19","rawR":"Neh.12.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.19","value":"Neh.12.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["7. One of the priests (or Levites) who participated in the dedication of the rebuilt temple (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.42","r":"Neh.12.42","rawR":"Neh.12.42","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.42","value":"Neh.12.42"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:42"},"). He may be the same as #5 or #6 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Uzzi","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:5-6, 51","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.5-6,51","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.5-6,51","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.5-6,51"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 7:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.7.4","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.7.4","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.7.4"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:2-3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.2-3","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.2-3","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.2-3"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.7","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.7","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.7"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.8","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.8","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.8"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.22","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.22","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.22"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.19","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.19","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.19"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:42","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.42","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.42","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.42"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"3ffbfad4f73ab00fea92446e8d650502e68f3bdfb6f76f39448c37e332d7a3fe","sourceItemName":"Uzzi","sourceItemOrder":40,"sourceMember":"Articles/U.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Uzzi","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Uzzi","title":"Uzzi","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}